@fn _expect
@purpose Consume an expected token; return an error diagnostic on mismatch without advancing.
@pre p.pos is within tokens (bounds-checked by _cur). [src: parser.aria:24-28]
@post On match: returns _adv(p). On mismatch: adds E0001 and returns p unchanged — CALLER MUST ADVANCE OR BAIL. [src: parser.aria:51-56]
@antipatterns The non-advancing semantics is load-bearing for some recovery paths but trap-laden in loops. See _parse_closure_expr for the canonical footgun. [src: parser.aria:2813-2825]

