@fn _parse_prefix
@purpose Parse prefix operators and atoms: literals, identifiers, control flow (if/match/select/spawn/scope), grouping, arrays, blocks.
@complexity O(1) for literals/idents; O(n) for recursive constructs (closures, blocks, if/match chains). [src: parser.aria:1884-2050]

