@fn _parse_postfix
@purpose Handle field access, method calls, indexing, struct/record literals, type constructors after a left operand.
@pre p is positioned after a complete left operand; the operand Expr is passed in. [src: parser.aria:2124]
@complexity O(k) where k = number of chained postfix operators. [src: parser.aria:2124]

